      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1558 - In a narration from Ibn Abi Umayr, from Al-Sadiq (as), He said:\n\"Whoever prays two light (short) units of prayer (Rak'ahs), reciting 'Qul Huwa Allahu Ahad' (Surah Al-Ikhlas) sixty times in each Rak'ah, will finish the prayer without any sins remaining between him and Allah (swt), the Mighty and Exalted.\""
